### Spring Boot MVC REST Client
### Use this file with the REST Client extension in VS Code
### Install: REST Client extension by Huachao Mao

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. GET Home Page
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### 2. GET Hello Page with parameter
GET {{baseUrl}}/hello?name=John

### 3. GET Hello Page with different name
GET {{baseUrl}}/hello?name=Pradeep

### 4. POST Form Submission
POST {{baseUrl}}/submit
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

inputValue=Hello from REST Client

### 5. POST Form Submission with different value
POST {{baseUrl}}/submit
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

inputValue=Testing Spring Boot MVC Application

### 6. POST Form Submission with empty value
POST {{baseUrl}}/submit
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

inputValue=
